		Texy\Modules\BlockModule::beforeBlockParse: 'work with the nodes in a pass registered by `Texy\Texy::addPass()` or a renderer registered by `Texy\Output\Html\Config::addRenderer()`'
		Texy\Modules\EmoticonModule::solve: 'work with the nodes in a pass registered by `Texy\Texy::addPass()` or a renderer registered by `Texy\Output\Html\Config::addRenderer()`'
